DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261130
SUMMARY:Advent Week 1: Hope
DESCRIPTION:Long before Jesus was born\, God promised he was coming. This w
 eek\, we remember those promises and the hope they bring.\n\nThis week's a
 ctivities: https://advent.firstpresfc.org/#week-1
